          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "इष्टका (iṣṭakā) is the word MW records for a brick, first a brick of the sacrificial altar; MW gives no derivation, so its origin is uncertain (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
